{"overview":"فوگوئی و جیاژن حوادث پرفراز و نشیبی را در چین تحمل می‌کنند، زیرا ثروت شخصی آنها از ملاکی ثروتمند به رعیت تغییر می‌کند. فوگوئی که معتاد به قمار است، همه چیز را از دست می‌دهد. در سال‌های بعد، او در هر دو ارتش‌ ملی‌گرا و کمونیست به خدمت گرفته می‌شود، در حالی که جیاژن مجبور به کارهای سطح پایین می‌شود.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Married couple Fugui and Jiazhen endure tumultuous events in mid-20th century mainland China as their personal fortunes move from wealthy landownership to peasantry.","tagline_en":"","runtime":133,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["ژانگ ییمو"],"crew_en":["Zhang Yimou"],"countries":["CN","HK"],"cast":[{"name":"葛优","role":"Xu Fugui","photo":"/s0JXQhCmKUmtxiuI2rjH8hfE470.jpg","en":"Ge You"},{"name":"گونگ لی","role":"Xu Jiazhen","photo":"/kMdN44dyjTRZvagI5nKwbZYwda9.jpg","en":"Gong Li"},{"name":"牛犇","role":"Town Chief","photo":"/4OotJ4kv3BbLHfdBl5qRHyD25U3.jpg","en":"Niu Ben"},{"name":"郭涛","role":"Chunsheng","photo":"/5MZW82Bw5hif66xcBgwx9Lvxkdo.jpg","en":"Guo Tao"},{"name":"姜武","role":"Wan Erxi","photo":"/f8BXK5pb9yoREZq3ROM9hSBgvlk.jpg","en":"Jiang Wu"},{"name":"倪大红","role":"Long'er","photo":"/4Eo2UHZTIyo6WU5I3zqIb60je9U.jpg","en":"Ni Dahong"},{"name":"刘天池","role":"Xu Fengxia","photo":"/2zwMq85pjkYaan56MeoTAtg2d0T.jpg","en":"Liu Tianchi"},{"name":"Zhang Lu","role":"Young Fengxia","photo":"/9TgpDYx0GjvLL0MBuYvYhpO9Ecx.jpg"},{"name":"Dong Fei","role":"Xu Youqing","photo":"/vpiQOacKMMiSdTbJWTNN6wq1RVa.jpg"},{"name":"Huang Zongluo","role":"Fugui's Dad","photo":"/9fMZ9Xq7a36frcTQZxUFmNq4WoW.jpg"},{"name":"Liu Yanjin","role":"Fugui's Mom","photo":"/x2twsC18dYQXu5SF4C7yMOTBdoQ.jpg"},{"name":"Li Lianyi","role":"Sgt. Lao Quan","photo":"/g5x3gwjuQnTL7RvF7QxJ0XwATva.jpg"}],"trailer":"GAZUbjttUPc","watch":{},"recs":[],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/31439"}